    "title": "Kaya's Evening Surprise",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was on vacation, enjoying life.",
      "Her parent and aunt also took us shopping.",
      "Before going, Kaya took a bath.",
      "She chose white shorts which were on sale.",
      "That was twenty percent off, a great deal for 1,800 yen!",
      "Later, they walked to a Hindu restaurant.",
      "Its menu had a lot of different recipes, and so on.",
      "Kaya ordered an iced tea. It tasted fine.",
      "A boy entered with other children.",
      "He was their national team captain. Wow!",
      "His fast teammate wore a jogging suit. \"They're busy!\"",
      "One child left his bag. Whose was it? Don't touch it."
    ]
